{"id":72975,"date":"2026-11-07T06:44:16","date_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:44:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72975"},"modified":"2026-11-07T07:45:52","modified_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:45:52","slug":"trail-sao-goncalo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-sao-goncalo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Solid\u00e1rio S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Solid\u00e1rio S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Solid\u00e1rio S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>29 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), com partida e chegada na <strong>Capela de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Monte C\u00f3rdova<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Santo Tirso<\/strong> (distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>). Co-organizado pelo <strong>NAST \u2014 N\u00facleo Associativo de Santo Tirso<\/strong> e pela associa\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Amigos de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo<\/strong>, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Santo Tirso e da Junta de Freguesia de Monte C\u00f3rdova, o evento reverte a favor das obras de beneficia\u00e7\u00e3o do recinto da Capela de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sob o lema \u00abNatureza, Comunidade e Solidariedade\u00bb, a iniciativa de car\u00e1ter solid\u00e1rio e n\u00e3o competitivo integra duas dist\u00e2ncias pelos trilhos e caminhos florestais de Monte C\u00f3rdova: o <strong>Trail de 15 km (+600 m D+)<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> (idade m\u00ednima de 18 anos), e a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km (+400 m D+)<\/strong>, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>09h45<\/strong> (aberta a maiores de 14 anos, sendo que menores de 18 anos devem ir acompanhados por um adulto respons\u00e1vel).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O secretariado funciona no recinto da Capela de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo entre as 07h00 e as 09h00, encerrando a manh\u00e3 desportiva com refor\u00e7o final e um arraial conv\u00edvio a partir das 12h00. No Trail de 15 km \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar manta t\u00e9rmica, apito e telem\u00f3vel operacional. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Capela de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo, Monte C\u00f3rdova, Santo Tirso, Porto<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Trail 15 km (600m D