de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui o Trail de 15 km (+600 m D+) com partida \u00e0s 09h30 e a Caminhada de 8 km (+400 m D+) com partida \u00e0s 09h45. O secretariado funciona das 07h00 \u00e0s 09h00 e o arraial conv\u00edvio inicia-se \u00e0s 12h00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual \u00e9 a causa solid\u00e1ria?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 12,00 \u20ac para o Trail de 15 km e 8,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada de 8 km, revertendo os fundos angariados para as obras de beneficia\u00e7\u00e3o do recinto da Capela de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, lembran\u00e7as, medalha de finalista, abastecimentos, refor\u00e7o no final e seguro desportivo. No Trail de 15 km \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel operacional e apito (na caminhada \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio telem\u00f3vel operacional).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial do Trail Solid\u00e1rio S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial completo em formato PDF pode ser descarregado diretamente atrav\u00e9s do bot\u00e3o de regulamento dispon\u00edvel nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Solid\u00e1rio S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Capela de S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo, Monte C\u00f3rdova, Santo Tirso\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santo Tirso\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Solid\u00e1rio S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo 2026 realiza-se a 29 de novembro em Monte C\u00f3rdova, Santo Tirso, com Trail de 15 km (600m D+) e Caminhada de 8 km. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-trail-sao-goncalo.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Solid\u00e1rio S\u00e3o Gon\u00e7alo 15 km (+600 m D+)\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-solidario-sao-goncalo-2026\", \"validFrom\": \"2026-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada Solid